  "notes": "{一位|いちい} indicates first place or the top rank.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {一位|いちい}を{取|と}る: to take first place\n- {一位|いちい}を{獲得|かくとく}する: to win first place\n- {一位|いちい}になる: to become number one\n- {世界|せかい}{一位|いちい}: world's number one\n- {売|う}り{上|あ}げ{一位|いちい}: number one in sales\n- {人気|にんき}{一位|いちい}: most popular (first in popularity)\n\nRANKINGS:\n- {一位|いちい}、{二位|にい}、{三位|さんい}...\n- {何位|なんい}: what place/rank\n\nDIFFERENT PRONUNCIATIONS:\nNote that {一位|いちい} has different kanji readings in other contexts:\n- {位|くらい} as a counter for rank/position\n- {一|いち}+{位|い} = first place",
